1. G. Strang, *Introduction to Linear Algebra*, 6th ed., Wellesley-Cambridge Press (2023), sections 6.3 and 8.3.
2. M. W. Hirsch, S. Smale and R. L. Devaney, *Differential Equations, Dynamical Systems, and an Introduction to Chaos*,
   3rd ed., Academic Press (2013), chapters 3 to 6.
3. C. Moler and C. Van Loan, "Nineteen dubious ways to compute the exponential of a matrix, twenty-five years later",
   *SIAM Review* 45 (2003) 3–49.
4. C. Jordan, *Traité des substitutions et des équations algébriques*, Gauthier-Villars (1870).
